                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "~What catches my eyes was the location section moving, I don't remember it moving that much.~ It was just imagination I think. Is there a way to configure it to always add a space on the tenth column like with the cursor column location ?",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\"><del>What catches my eyes was the location section moving, I don't remember it moving that much.</del> It was just imagination I think. Is there a way to configure it to always add a space on the tenth column like with the cursor column location ?</p>",
