                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Yes: write custom `config.content.active` (you can use [default content](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e554890210cd29d017d6a0c1b1a46f995dcf9e64/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L86-L106) as starting point) and instead of `section_location()` use variation of [its code](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e554890210cd29d017d6a0c1b1a46f995dcf9e64/lua/mini/statusline.lua#L431-L435) directly. In this case, replace `%l` and `%L` with `%2l` and `%-2L`.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes: write custom <code class=\"notranslate\">config.content.active</code> (you can use <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e554890210cd29d017d6a0c1b1a46f995dcf9e64/doc/mini-statusline.txt#L86-L106\">default content</a> as starting point) and instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">section_location()</code> use variation of <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/e554890210cd29d017d6a0c1b1a46f995dcf9e64/lua/mini/statusline.lua#L431-L435\">its code</a> directly. In this case, replace <code class=\"notranslate\">%l</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">%L</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">%2l</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">%-2L</code>.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Yes: write custom config.content.active (you can use default content as starting point) and instead of section_location() use variation of its code directly. In this case, replace %l and %L with %2l and %-2L.",
