                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Ok, that pretty cool, thanks.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e82ac0d7-c611-458b-8998-ae32a5866938)\r\n\r\nGot this in the end.\r\n```lua\r\nlocal location = mini_statusline.is_truncated(75) and '%2l│%-2v' or '%2l|%-2L│%2v|%-2{virtcol(\"$\") - 1}'\r\n```",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ok, that pretty cool, thanks.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/93912163/417624383-e82ac0d7-c611-458b-8998-ae32a5866938.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..oqV0GVU4QK5A_CdAPlEouY5t2Wq_bCvA3Pklt3Tleqo\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/93912163/417624383-e82ac0d7-c611-458b-8998-ae32a5866938.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..oqV0GVU4QK5A_CdAPlEouY5t2Wq_bCvA3Pklt3Tleqo\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Got this in the end.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"local location = mini_statusline.is_truncated(75) and '%2l│%-2v' or '%2l|%-2L│%2v|%-2{virtcol(&quot;$&quot;) - 1}'\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-k\">local</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">location</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-smi\">mini_statusline</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">is_truncated</span>(<span class=\"pl-c1\">75</span>) <span class=\"pl-k\">and</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>%2l│%-2v<span class=\"pl-pds\">' </span></span><span class=\"pl-k\">or</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>%2l|%-2L│%2v|%-2{virtcol(\"$\") - 1}<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span></pre></div>",
                    "bodyText": "Ok, that pretty cool, thanks.\n\nGot this in the end.\nlocal location = mini_statusline.is_truncated(75) and '%2l│%-2v' or '%2l|%-2L│%2v|%-2{virtcol(\"$\") - 1}'",
